2.51.1-1 [2026-10-28]
- Added support for per-user and per-machine installations through a single MSI, with enhanced security for SYSTEM-level operations, including download verification, safe file deletion, path validation, and crash-safe self-updates.
- Added SHA-256 hashes for browser and Update Assistant releases to the manifests.
- Removed the legacy Ulaa Updater from build and release scripts.
- Updated with the latest security patches and performance enhancements. Chromium engine updated to 156.0.8078.74.
